*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.csr
*.der
*.secret
*.secrets
auth.txt
auth-user-pass.txt

# Thư mục staging profile: chỉ giữ README hướng dẫn
vpn-profiles/**
!vpn-profiles/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
